NATURE OF THE ADAPTATION
------------------------

Scenario clinical content follows a source note but is restructured into a
fixed ten-fact schema, with identifying specifics generalised. The scenarios
are not verbatim copies of source notes. Describe the material as derived from
real transcribed clinical text, restructured and generalised - not as real
clinical records, and not as fully synthetic.


